//   ⏸ ghost-guard defer <fullHeadSha> — run <id> still queued at <iso>
//   🧹 ghost-guard clean <fullHeadSha> — <N> orphaned check-run(s) concluded at <iso>
//
// A head can sit queued across MANY ticks before its jobs materialize, and
