 * The dead-head park threshold: 3 consecutive no-ref failures on one head
 * (gh-922 ask 3, "suggest 3"). jobParams.triggerFailParkCap tunes it per
 * deployment; 0 / negative / 'false' disables the marker+park bookkeeping
