2. Test: '422: Unprocessable Entity (no ref word)' → change string so it truly lacks 'ref': '422: Unprocessable Entity — invalid input'.
3. Test: malformed count line — change expectation: unparsable lines are ignored (no entry): `assert.equal(marks['c/three'], undefined, ...)` — rename test accordingly.

